<title>UK: Deutsche Bank unit sets 500 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank unit sets 500 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE (NETHERLANDS) BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    15.AUG.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.60    PAY DATE    15.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    SWISS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
